  "system": {
    "description": "<section class=\"scrpg-archetype-block scrpg-archetype-block-intro\"><p>An external source caused you to manifest powers or perhaps the cure for an accident caused it.</p></section><section class=\"scrpg-archetype-block\"><div class=\"scrpg-archetype-section\">Powers</div><p>Assign all the dice you rolled at the end of the background step to any of the following powers:</p><p>• Select from Athletic powers category</p><p>• Select from Elemental/Energy powers category</p><p>• Select from Intellectual powers category</p><p>• Select from Materials powers category</p><p>• Select from Psychic powers category</p><p>• Select from Self Control powers category</p></section><section class=\"scrpg-archetype-block\"><div class=\"scrpg-archetype-section\">Abilities</div><p>Gain two of these Yellow abilities, each using a different power:</p><ul class=\"scrpg-archetype-ability-links\"><li>@UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.abilities.Item.rH74GhehJpAtALYR]{Area Alteration}</li><li>@UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.abilities.Item.VAUyGwApaTOkHmHe]{Inflict}</li><li>@UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.abilities.Item.UL1tw6hVedoFeimF]{Reflexive Burst}</li></ul><p>Gain one of these Green abilities:</p><ul class=\"scrpg-archetype-ability-links\"><li>@UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.abilities.Item.aPsvIm1EFK1S1ejN]{Ambush Awareness}</li><li>@UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.abilities.Item.cy9AVkrCByZaSKm1]{Change in Circumstance}</li><li>@UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.abilities.Item.AzntVIjO1ZqW93Ep]{Immunity}</li></ul></section><section class=\"scrpg-archetype-block\"><div class=\"scrpg-archetype-section\">Archetype</div><p>Roll d12, d6 for archetype selection.</p></section>"
